    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cronin Wall Properties are excited to bring Ballyrobin, Cloyne to the open sales market. A charming, detached bungalow set in a wonderful countryside setting with beautifully maintained gardens. Fully renovated in 1997, the property boasts an inviting and bright interior and spacious layout of c. 1,157 ft². In a fantastic addition, the property is complete with two detached, concrete build garages with power supply.\r\n\r\nRetaining its charming early 1900s exterior, this exceptional property seamlessly blends period character with contemporary finishes to create a bright and welcoming home. Thoughtfully designed throughout, the accommodation comprises of an inviting entrance hall, a spacious kitchen and dining living room filled with natural light, W.C., two bedrooms, and a large attic space.\r\n\r\nPerfectly suited to those seeking a low-maintenance lifestyle without compromising on space or everyday convenience. The property is located just a short drive Cloyne Village where a wonderful selection of amenities can be found including National School, Chemist, Church, Gym, Play-Ground, Pubs etc. and just a 20 minute drive from Midleton where further amenities can be found plus access to the N25.\r\n\r\nViewing this idyllic, charming property and picturesque setting is a must!\r\n\r\nAccommodation consists of: Entrance hallway, living room, kitchen, master bedroom, bedroom 2, bathroom, laundry room, attic space plus two concrete built garages.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway 1.88 x 1.74m Laminate floor, radiator, frosted glass door.\r\n\r\nLiving Room 3.92 x 5.57m Laminate floor, brickwork fireplace with mantle, storage units, radiator, overhead light fixtures.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 3.41m x 5.53m Floor tiling, radiator, light fixtures, large kitchen unit with glass cabinet details, fridge, Electric oven/ hob.\r\n\r\nMaster bedroom: 3.89m x 2.93m Carpet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.38m x 1.99m Carpet.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.08 x 2.38m Tiled flooring, W.H.B. with vanity unit, W.C., tiled shower unit with electric shower, light fixture.\r\n\r\nLaundry Room 1.20 x 2.37m Washing machine, storage units, access to back garden, tiled flooring, radiator, Light fixtures.\r\n\r\nAttic 4.87m x 5.00m Large attic space"
      },
      {
